'''Vanquisher Set''' is a group of four different [[Equipment]] pieces, and the upgraded set of the [[Crimson Hunter Set]]: {{Item|Vanquished Blaze Belt}}, {{Item|Vanquished Ghast Cloak}}, {{Item|Vanquished Magma Necklace}}, and {{Item|Vanquished Glowstone Gauntlet}}.

