Each of the pieces has its own {{AN|Piece Bonus}}, that requires doing a specific task, and in return it grants additional stats to the player when the item is worn. The abilities have {{Green|10}} tiers, each requiring {{yellow|1,000}} actions. Since the stats aren't granted to the item, they are not affected by [[Star Upgrades]]. In total the full set of equipment can grant up to {{stat|cd|10}}, {{stat|def|10}}, {{stat|str|10}} and {{stat|int|10}}.

== Notes ==
*It is important to note that the Stats from this equipment's Piece Bonuses doesn't show in the items' stats, which might give the false impression of it giving up to fewer stats less than they actually give.

== Trivia ==
*Despite all the pieces being named '''Vanquished''', the set bonus and the set itself is named after the mob {{MobSprite|Vanquisher}}.
*Despite [[Blaze Pet]]'s Nether Embodiment perk working on both [[Crimson Isle]] and [[Kuudra]], Vanquisher Set does not work inside of [[Kuudra]].

